CMC is associated with the School of Electrical and Computer Engineering (ECE). We are funded in part by ECE and our alumni donors.

Currently the club has lab spaces at 217 Phillips Hall (Electrical Lab) and 201 Phillips Hall (Mechanical Lab). Specific training is required to access each lab space.

